  "facts_of_case": "Marriage of Bhawna Rani and Gurdeep Singh was solemnized in 2012. A female child was born out of the wedlock. Gurdeep Singh filed a petition for divorce under Section 13 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955. The Family Court granted a decree of divorce on March 2, 2020. Bhawna Rani appealed against this order.",
